<view class="page">
  <view class="order-card" wx:if="{{title || serviceTypeLabel}}">
    <view class="order-card-title">📋 抢单订单</view>
    <view class="order-row">
      <text class="order-label">工种</text>
      <text class="order-value">{{title || serviceTypeLabel}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="order-row" wx:if="{{serviceTypeLabel && title && serviceTypeLabel !== title}}">
      <text class="order-label">订单</text>
      <text class="order-value">{{title}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="form-card">
    <view class="section-title">您的信息</view>

    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="form-label">姓名 <text class="req">*</text></text>
      <input class="form-input" placeholder="请输入您的真实姓名"
             value="{{form.name}}" bindinput="onInput" data-field="name" maxlength="20"/>
    </view>

    <view class="form-item last">
      <text class="form-label">手机号 <text class="req">*</text></text>
      <input class="form-input" type="number" maxlength="11"
             placeholder="请输入手机号" value="{{form.phone}}"
             bindinput="onInput" data-field="phone"/>
      <view class="phone-wx-hint" wx:if="{{phoneFromWx && form.phone}}">
        <text>✓ 已通过微信授权填入</text>
      </view>
      <button class="wx-phone-btn" open-type="getPhoneNumber"
              bindgetphonenumber="onGetPhoneNumber">
        <text class="wx-phone-icon">📱</text>
        <text>使用微信手机号一键填入</text>
      </button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="tip-card">
    <text class="tip-text">
      ⚠️ 同一手机号对同一订单仅可抢一次；抢单成功后，归属顾问将主动与您联系，请保持电话畅通。
    </text>
  </view>

  <view class="btn-wrap">
    <button class="submit-btn {{submitting ? 'btn-disabled' : ''}}"
            bindtap="onSubmit" disabled="{{submitting}}">
      {{submitting ? '提交中...' : '确认抢单'}}
    </button>
  </view>
</view>
